msgctxt "scienceDB"
msgid "Adv. Gunship"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/cpu_ship_diversification_scenario_utility.lua:1021
msgid ""
"The Advanced Gunship corvette adds a second homing missile tube to damage "
"targets at range, and dual front-firing beams to finish its foes off. It's "
"designed to quickly take out enemies weaker then itself."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/cpu_ship_diversification_scenario_utility.lua:1023
msgid "Version II has stronger beams but a weaker hull."
