"Hornet models, its beam weapon has a longer but narrower range and does more "
"damage, its maximum impulse speed and turn rate are faster, and its hull is "
"weaker."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/cpu_ship_diversification_scenario_utility.lua:1101
msgctxt "scienceDB"
msgid "MT55 Hornet"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/cpu_ship_diversification_scenario_utility.lua:1120
msgctxt "scienceDB"
msgid ""
"The MT55 Hornet is similar to the other Hornet models. Its impulse speed is "
"faster but is slower to turn."
msgstr ""

