msgctxt "scienceDB"
msgid ""
"The MV52 Hornet is similar to the MT52 and MU52 models. Compared to other "
"Hornet models, the beam does more damage, its maximum impulse speed is "
"faster, it turns faster than the MT52, but it's slower than the MU52."
msgstr ""

